 Trello
 
The essential guide to scheduling based on your role
 
Are you a maker or a manager? A well-planned schedule helps to maximize your productivity, but it's not a one-size-fits-all solution. Here's how you should be planning out your day based on your role. 
 
Pencil that in
>> https://blog.trello.com/maker-vs-manager-productivity?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-august2023-newsletter1_EML-16130
  
  
Trello Tips: set up your productivity dashboard
 
Slay the dragons of tab overload, context switching, and lost productivity! This article walks you through how you can use Trello to create your ultimate productivity dashboard. 
 
Crush your goals
>> https://blog.trello.com/trello-productivity-guide?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-august2023-newsletter1_EML-16130
  
  
6 simple steps for an effective project plan
 
Let's face it: project planning isn't for everyone. Unclear responsibilities, poor planning, and overallocation often cause an undue amount of stress for everyone involved. Here are 6 simple steps you can follow for a foolproof project plan.  
 
You've got this
>> https://blog.trello.com/write-an-effective-project-plan?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-august2023-newsletter1_EML-16130
  
  
Onboarding and orientation: do you need both? 
 
Your new hire experience is essential to getting new team members up to speed quickly and effectively. Onboarding and orientation are commonly used interchangeably, but they each serve a different purpose and can enhance your overall hiring process.  
 
Prep for hires
>> https://blog.trello.com/onboarding-vs-orientation-your-questions-answered-trello?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-august2023-newsletter1_EML-16130
  
  
Have you joined the Work Management Community yet? 
>> https://community.atlassian.com/t5/Work-Management/gh-p/work-management?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-august2023-newsletter1_EML-16130
 
Learn and share tips, tricks, and new ways to use Confluence, Trello, Atlas, and other tools for Work Management in this new community group.
 
Join now
>> https://community.atlassian.com/t5/Work-Management/gh-p/work-management?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-august2023-newsletter1_EML-16130

